[38;2;124;124;124mActually, let me reconsider. The question is about the identity map $C^\infty_c [0m[38;2;124;124;124m\hookrightarrow \mathcal{M}$ extending by continuity. This means: if $\{u_j\} [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m\subset C^\infty_c$ is Cauchy in $W^{k,2}$, then $\{u_j\}$ converges in $[0m
